    <string name="rift_cloud_how_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="rift_cloud_how">1. Sign in with the Microsoft account that has Game Pass Ultimate. xbox.com opens in Rift\'s browser and closes by itself once you are in.\n2. The Cloud streaming tab appears on the home screen with the Game Pass cloud games.\n3. A opens a game\'s page, “Play in the cloud” starts it. The gamepad\'s Home opens the side panel with “End stream” and the main settings; the rest are here, in the Stream and Interface tabs.\nXbox Cloud Gaming is not available in every country; where it is not, it needs a VPN.</string>

